      "comment": "ROCK IT ROGER (2) has a terrific record this trip with four wins and two placings from six starts. Hit the frame latest (26.01) when second at Murray Bridge in a Grade 6. Makes strong appeal on best. ROCKLEA EARLE (3) shapes well for this on his slick win a few runs back, getting around this track over 305m in 17.61 then hitting the frame in both runs since. Rates a leading chance if runs up to recent winning time. MISTER CADILLAC (4) is looking to continue his winning ways off a superb 22.99 victory at this track. This tougher but expected to be in the finish. TRADING HALT (6) flew the lids and led all the way last time. Will be thereabouts.",
